{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":227043,"name":"orhan kemal cetin","username":"orhankemalcetin","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/o/c68b51/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-08-09T13:15:47.634Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHello,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am an individual developer based in Turkey, planning to build and publish a paid Forge app on the Marketplace. Before I invest development time I would like to confirm my eligibility, and I am hoping someone here has been through this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe public documentation appears to conflict on this point:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- “Become a partner on Atlassian Marketplace” states that a developer without a parent company can create a partner profile using their own name.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- The partner due diligence section refers to a “registration and/or tax ID number”, which suggests a registered business may be required.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- A thread from July 2026 asking essentially the same question for a UK sole trader was escalated internally as ECOHELP-151223, and no public answer was ever posted.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy questions:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1. Can an individual, without a registered limited company, publish PAID apps (paid via Atlassian) on the Marketplace? Or is a registered business entity mandatory for monetized listings?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. If an entity is required, is a sole proprietorship with a tax registration sufficient, or does it have to be a limited liability company?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. Is Turkey a supported country for Marketplace Partners who sell paid apps? Are there any country-specific restrictions worth knowing before starting?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. What identity and tax documentation is requested during partner onboarding (for example W-8BEN, tax residency certificate, business registration document)?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5. Does any of this differ between Forge and Connect apps, or between “paid via Atlassian” and “paid via vendor”?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf anyone here is selling paid apps as an individual rather than through a company, I would really appreciate hearing how your onboarding went.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-08-09T13:15:47.634Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":8,"reads":25,"readers_count":24,"score":45.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":102081,"topic_slug":"can-an-individual-sole-proprietor-based-in-turkey-publish-and-sell-paid-marketplace-apps","display_username":"orhan kemal cetin","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://community.developer.atlassian.com/t/is-canada-a-supported-payout-country-for-marketplace-partners/103113/3","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Is Canada a supported payout country for Marketplace Partners?","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":45316,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-an-individual-sole-proprietor-based-in-turkey-publish-and-sell-paid-marketplace-apps/102081/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":227402,"name":"Mihai Perdum","username":"Mihai_leanzero","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.developer.atlassian.com/mihai_leanzero/{size}/55980_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-19T12:56:07.472Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/orhankemalcetin\"\u003e@orhankemalcetin\u003c/a\u003e, that July thread got its answer, one day after you posted this one.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDOhertyryan came back on \u003ca href=\"https://community.developer.atlassian.com/t/can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor/101919/7\"\u003e101919, post 7\u003c/a\u003e on 2026-08-10: the Marketplace Partner team sent him a full document through ECOHELP-151223, and he says it confirmed a UK sole trader can register on the individual path. His question was paid registration and payouts, same as yours.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHe is reporting a private document though, and none of it was Turkey-specific, so your country question is still open. I’d ask it the way he did. Ian pointed him at \u003ca href=\"https://ecosystem.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/34/group/110/create/654\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ethis portal form\u003c/a\u003e, he raised the request there, and Ian endorsed it internally. One snag he flagged at post 4: the form demands a numeric Partner/Vendor ID that a prospective partner cannot have yet. He entered 0 and explained it in the first line of the description.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-08-19T12:56:07.472Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":13,"readers_count":12,"score":2.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":102081,"topic_slug":"can-an-individual-sole-proprietor-based-in-turkey-publish-and-sell-paid-marketplace-apps","display_username":"Mihai Perdum","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://community.developer.atlassian.